== 5. God’s Secret Decrees

=== The fifth #emph[device] that Satan has to keep a sinner and Christ apart, is,

BY working on a sinner to think more on the secret decrees and counsels of God than on his own duty. “Why do you need to busy yourself about receiving, embracing, and welcoming Christ?” says Satan. “If you are elected, you will be saved; if not, all that you can do will do you no good.” Indeed, he will work on the soul not only to doubt its election, but to conclude that he is not elected, and that therefore, let him do what he can, he will never be saved.

#strong[Now the remedies against this #emph[device] of Satan are these.]

The first #emph[remedy] is, seriously to consider that neither all the angels in heaven, nor all the men on earth, nor all the devils in hell can say that you are not an elect person, a chosen vessel. You may be confident of this: God never made Satan one of his Privy Council. God never acquainted him with the names or persons of those on whom he has set his love to eternity, etc.

The second #emph[remedy] against this #emph[device] of Satan is, to concern yourself with what you have to do. Secret things belong to the Lord, but revealed#footnote[Deut 29:29.] things belong to you. Your work, sinner, is to be resolute in believing and in returning to the Lord. Your work is to cast yourself on Christ, to lie at his feet, to wait on him in his ways, and to give him no rest till he says, “Sinner, I am your portion, I am your salvation, and nothing will separate you and me.”
